    "detailed_description": "Uniseas is a real-time strategy game about pirates!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1229250/extras/20a2f6de2d32f5496a65684fc21790ca.avif?t=1639496754\" /></div><br><br>You play as a newcomer, eager to dominate the new world.<br>You capture islands, raising new homes and shipyards. You build small boats for trading and big ships for taking over more islands!<br><br>However, you are not the only one with big dreams. Your ambitions are contested by 3 other pirate captains:<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1229250/extras/850caefe249824c2fef29494d056a61b.avif?t=1639496754\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1229250/extras/36ebdd8635143715f6462d14363c0bf9.avif?t=1639496754\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1229250/extras/8a775924fd5bc347afa7d59206cb4e50.avif?t=1639496754\" /></div>     <br><br>Your relationship with each of them can influence your chances greatly. Once one of them becomes fully hostile towards you, the captain will come out with their flagship and attacks you. Defeat this boat and they will be  wiped out!<br><br>You will need to defeat each one of them to win the game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1229250/extras/3574da278cd0d185d2be6c61bb32fb1b.poster.avif?t=1639496754\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1229250/extras/3574da278cd0d185d2be6c61bb32fb1b.webm?t=1639496754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1229250/extras/3574da278cd0d185d2be6c61bb32fb1b.mp4?t=1639496754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>about 1 hour playtime<br></li><li>full fake 3D<br></li><li>random generated maps</li></ul><br><strong>Controls &amp; hotkeys</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>ASWD / Arrow keys : move camera<br></li><li>Q+E : rotate camera<br></li><li>mouse scroll wheel : zoom<br></li><li>TAB : select next boat<br></li><li>left mouse button : select boat / move here / attack boat / select dock<br></li><li>right mouse button : deselect<br></li><li>other keyboard keys : next tutorial dialogue</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1229250/extras/c350ac25322f0cc81d29044611c576b9.avif?t=1639496754\" /></div><br>Sokpop makes a new game every two weeks!<br>Subscribe for 3$ per month at <br><br>Character portraits design by C\u00e9line Veltman (@CelineVeltman)",
    "about_the_game": "Uniseas is a real-time strategy game about pirates!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1229250/extras/20a2f6de2d32f5496a65684fc21790ca.avif?t=1639496754\" /></div><br><br>You play as a newcomer, eager to dominate the new world.<br>You capture islands, raising new homes and shipyards. You build small boats for trading and big ships for taking over more islands!<br><br>However, you are not the only one with big dreams. Your ambitions are contested by 3 other pirate captains:<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1229250/extras/850caefe249824c2fef29494d056a61b.avif?t=1639496754\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1229250/extras/36ebdd8635143715f6462d14363c0bf9.avif?t=1639496754\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1229250/extras/8a775924fd5bc347afa7d59206cb4e50.avif?t=1639496754\" /></div>     <br><br>Your relationship with each of them can influence your chances greatly. Once one of them becomes fully hostile towards you, the captain will come out with their flagship and attacks you. Defeat this boat and they will be  wiped out!<br><br>You will need to defeat each one of them to win the game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1229250/extras/3574da278cd0d185d2be6c61bb32fb1b.poster.avif?t=1639496754\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1229250/extras/3574da278cd0d185d2be6c61bb32fb1b.webm?t=1639496754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1229250/extras/3574da278cd0d185d2be6c61bb32fb1b.mp4?t=1639496754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>about 1 hour playtime<br></li><li>full fake 3D<br></li><li>random generated maps</li></ul><br><strong>Controls &amp; hotkeys</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>ASWD / Arrow keys : move camera<br></li><li>Q+E : rotate camera<br></li><li>mouse scroll wheel : zoom<br></li><li>TAB : select next boat<br></li><li>left mouse button : select boat / move here / attack boat / select dock<br></li><li>right mouse button : deselect<br></li><li>other keyboard keys : next tutorial dialogue</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1229250/extras/c350ac25322f0cc81d29044611c576b9.avif?t=1639496754\" /></div><br>Sokpop makes a new game every two weeks!<br>Subscribe for 3$ per month at <br><br>Character portraits design by C\u00e9line Veltman (@CelineVeltman)",
